}


### Test 8c: Duplicate SKU
POST http://localhost:8083/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

# Expected Response:
# 409 Conflict
# { "error": "SKU already exists" }

{
  "sku": "BREAD001",
  "name": "Duplicate SKU Test",
  "categoryId": "BREAD_CATEGORY_ID_HERE",
  "price": 10.00
}
